[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14041.83, "timestamp": "03:54:01", "text": "类似捐赠活动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14044.309, "timestamp": "03:54:04", "text": "因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14046.189, "timestamp": "03:54:06", "text": "嗯，我感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14049.91, "timestamp": "03:54:09", "text": "是啊，什么都需要钱。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14054.349, "timestamp": "03:54:14", "text": "虽然令人难过，但事实就是如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14057.91, "timestamp": "03:54:17", "text": "是。但问题是我不知道自己的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14061.229, "timestamp": "03:54:21", "text": "性格以及我有多固执"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14065.91, "timestamp": "03:54:25", "text": "是。说实话，我并不想问这个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14068.229, "timestamp": "03:54:28", "text": "像这样的帮助，就像社区一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14071.389, "timestamp": "03:54:31", "text": "资金援助就是这样的。我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14074.07, "timestamp": "03:54:34", "text": "就像我会担心一些事情一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14076.309, "timestamp": "03:54:36", "text": "关于未来，我总会想办法应对的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14080.79, "timestamp": "03:54:40", "text": "它。但我给自己定了一条规矩。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14083.99, "timestamp": "03:54:43", "text": "我从网上赚到的所有钱，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14086.55, "timestamp": "03:54:46", "text": "Vtubing，那只会回到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14089.03, "timestamp": "03:54:49", "text": "Vtubing 作为一种进步或其他什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14090.99, "timestamp": "03:54:50", "text": "拥有更好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14094.71, "timestamp": "03:54:54", "text": "事物。是的，这同样适用于音乐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14097.11, "timestamp": "03:54:57", "text": "在我的音乐生涯中，我也曾有过这样的经历。"}]